French meanings of the HSK words (data/fr/*.json)

Built by scripts/update-french.mjs from CFDICT, the free Chinese-French dictionary
by Chine Informations (https://chine.in), https://chine.in/mandarin/dictionnaire/CFDICT/,
with additions and corrections for HSK words it lacks or gets wrong (FRENCH_FIXES
in the script).

